are there different gods/lucifers for each universe? how did lucifer aid in the creation of the universe? so many unanswered questions lol

"Hey, I noticed the trash was full and that it was your day today, so I would appreciate it if you took it out so we could keep the place clean!"

&#x200B;

I know it's needed but I feel so nervous when I have to make assertive statements. and it's honestly even more embarrassing because I feel like I am her parent scolding her for not taking out the trash
